Sparkle 2.10.0
Archive: https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/releases/download/2.10.0/Sparkle-2.10.0.tar.xz
SHA-256: c2bf58aa8387266ac179357b1415d6f2635f044da8be41042af32425dae6da0c

Contents taken from the archive unchanged: Sparkle.framework (symlinks kept,
copied with ditto), bin/generate_keys, bin/sign_update, bin/generate_appcast,
bin/BinaryDelta, LICENSE.
One change: Sparkle.framework/XPCServices and Versions/B/XPCServices
(Downloader.xpc, Installer.xpc) are removed. SoundMix is not sandboxed, and
Sparkle's sandboxing guide allows removing the XPC Services in that case
(https://sparkle-project.org/documentation/sandboxing/, "Removing the XPC
Services"). build.sh re-signs the framework, so its original signature no
longer applies.
